Package: bsa-serviceregistry
Version: @VERSION@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Stanislav Batyrgareev <sbatyrgareev@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser, @DEPENDS@
Homepage: https://bsasearch.org/serviceregistry.html
Description: BSA Service Registry host - addresses of REST and TCP services
 HTTP API (ASP.NET Core) that returns addresses of REST and TCP services by
 name: services from the configuration and services registered at runtime,
 with round-robin choice of the least used address.
 Runs as the systemd service bsa-serviceregistry.
